<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Catra and Adora</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;As beautiful as this time of year was, Catra knew Adora was, at heart, a winter person. Cold, frigid air, stocked up boots and covered up clothes, hot drinks and warm fireplaces with loved ones. That was what Adora loved and looked forward to, year after year. Refusing to let go of her favorite season, she stuck with its traditions all through spring and summer despite her loverâ€™s multiple attempts at persuading her otherwise. It just wasnâ€™t in her nature to give up, heatstroke be damned, she always said.Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This year, Catra had crafted a master plan to cheer her partner up. Well, that was the goal though it could definitely go very bad very fast, all depending on Adoraâ€™s reaction.Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;--------&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or, the one where they get married at the end&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>bluest_bells</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
